<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cavalier half-yr profit falls 17 pct.</title>
<headline>Cavalier half-yr profit falls 17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   4.0 vs 4.8</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  6.0 vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   11.1 vs 13.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				96.7 vs 105.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  6.1 vs 7.3</p>
<p>    Tax					2.1 vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	     36.0 vs same</p>
<p>Pay date March 21</p>
<p>Reg date March 7</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 10</p>
<p>Note - Cavalier Corp Ltd is a carpet manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
